\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Finance Min/Advisor-3: Successful  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 223 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 November 1995\par 09:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  As a result, he said, 'the yen's role in the global marketplace is still confined to being one of the major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  Japanese officials, he said, have talked about ways to get the yen designated as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of choice for Asian countries. He didn't say how they would do that, but he said he opposed such a move on the grounds that it wouldn't be the choice of the market. \par \par \uc2  Market forces, in any case, are far more powerful than governments in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading, Gyohten said. He said coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by central banks to prop up an undervalued \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  or lower an overvalued one tend to be unsuccessful unless they coincide with market sentiment. \par \par \uc2  Gyohten cited two successful \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 : the 1985 'Plaza Accord' agreement in which U.S., British, Japanese, Italian and German central banks acted to bring down the value of the U.S. dollar; and the July 1995 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of U.S., Japanese and German banks to bolster the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Both \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  produced the desired effect, Gyohten said, because they had the same goal as market forces. 'The concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was effective only when the pendulum of overshooting was about to reach its extreme heights,' he said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 23-11-95 \par \par \uc2  0805GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbn09b7y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
