\par\par \b \uc2  Governor has presided over BOJ in turbulent year. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Linda Sieg \par \uc2 544 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 1995\par 06:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Nov 10 (Reuter) - Bank of Japan governor Yasuo Matsushita has been in office less than one year but it has been one of the most turbulent periods in Japan's post-war financial history. \par \par \uc2  A gyrating yen, interest rate cuts and unprecedented failures of financial institutions have rained down on the desk of the genteel governor, who is likely to be in hospital for up to one month after a prostate \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Matsushita was appointed governor in December 1994, a decision that was widely applauded both at home and abroad because he brought not only \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  experience but also hands-on knowledge of commercial banking. \par \par \uc2  Matsushita, 69, is a former administrative vice finance minister -- the finance ministry's top bureaucrat -- and joined the private sector in 1986. \par \par \uc2  In 1990, he presided over the largest merger in Japanese banking history when Taiyo Kobe Bank joined with Mitsui Bank to produce what is now Sakura Bank Ltd. \par \par \uc2  Matsushita served as Sakura Bank chairman until June 1994, when he became an adviser to the bank. \par \par \uc2  "He's not just a bureaucrat but a hands-on banker who is highly respected," Jesper Koll, head of markets research at JP Morgan in Tokyo, said at the time. \par \par \uc2  Matsushita's main tasks have been to try to nurture Japan's fragile economic recovery and to guide the financial system as it struggles to cope with the problem of banks' bad debts left over from the late-1980s "bubble economy" of soaring land prices. \par \par \uc2  There have been plenty of challenges. \par \par \uc2  The dollar stood at about 100 yen when he assumed office and it is about the same rate now. \par \par \uc2  But in between it has swung back and forth, plunging to a record low of 79.75 yen in mid-April. \par \par \uc2  Matsushita led the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to buy up the dollar against the yen and push the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to a level more favourable for Japanese business. \par \par \uc2  Urged by industries and the government to use monetary policy to help the economy, Matsushita acted twice, in April and September, to cut the official discount rate, the rate the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  charges on loans to commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  The cuts -- each by 0.5 percentage point -- have left the discount rate at a historic low of 0.5 percent. \par \par \uc2  Matsushita also directed bailout efforts for two credit unions and moves to deal with the failure of Hyogo Bank, a top regional bank. \par \par \uc2  In the week before he went into hospital for his \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Matsushita was one of the key players in limiting damage from the Daiwa Bank scandal. \par \par \uc2  Economists describe Matsushita as low key, but decisive and ever-courteous. \par \par \uc2  He spent 34 years in the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  before moving into the private sector. The stint included heading up the powerful budget bureau. \par \par \uc2  It was during his tenure as vice finance minister that the so-called U.S.-Japan "yen-dollar talks" were held, a process which kicked off a decade of financial liberalisation in Japan. \par \par \uc2  Matsushita graduated from the prestigious University of Tokyo and was a Fulbright scholar in 1952 at Syracuse University in New York. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drba01xyn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
