\par\par \b \uc2  Buba's Haeusler- \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  can work well. \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Oktober 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  FRANKFURT, Oct 24 (Reuter) - Bundesbank directorate member Gerd Haeusler said the experience of the Plaza Accord shows co-ordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  can at times work quite well. \par \par \uc2  In the text of a speech prepared for delivery in Tokyo to the International Symposium - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  Center for International Finance, Haeusler said, "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange markets may work, sometimes even quite well." \par \par \uc2  In 1985, representatives of the Group of Five -- France, Germany, Japan, the U.K. and the U.S. -- agreed at the Plaza Hotel in New York to drive an overappreciated dollar down. \par \par \uc2  Haeusler said that such \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not be successful against market trends unless central banks were willing to buy up the entire over-supply of a particular \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which runs counter to prudent monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  "Successful \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs favourable market conditions, that is, at least some vulnerable speculators with lop-sided positions," Haeusler said. A copy of the speech was made available in English to the news media here in advance. \par \par \uc2  Haeusler also said that one lesson from Plaza stemmed from financial market reaction to the surprise agreement, which moved the G-5 meetings into the limelight. \par \par \uc2  "By raising expectations in the markets and among the public at large, every time you meet you raise the stakes, and sometimes devote more time and energy to the communique than to the issues, which you can only successfully tackle in private," Haeusler said. \par \par \uc2  --Sharman Esarey, Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drao02pgc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
