\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar Steady Vs Yen, DEM In Nervous Trade \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Oktober 1995\par 18:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LONDON (DJTES)--The dollar held steady against the Deutsche mark and the Japanese yen in Europe Monday afternoon in thin trade, with the market remaining wary of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by central banks. \par \par \uc2  By 1600 GMT, the dollar had fallen to 1.4136 Deutsche marks from 1.4255 Friday, and to 100.45 yen from 100.76 yen. Sterling rose to $1.5856 from $1.5818. \par \par \uc2  The dollar declined slightly against the yen in Asia despite attempts to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the the Bank of Japan, but later stabilized as traders in Asia refocused on the possibility of concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the central banks of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the U.S. and Germany. \par \par \uc2  With a holiday in the U.S. on Monday and another in Japan on Tuesday, and in the absence of any major economic news, strategists in London said the dollar was likely to hold steady or decline slightly with the fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  still lingering. \par \par \uc2  Some strategists were disappointed that the weekend meeting of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors and finance ministers from the Group of Seven industrialized countries didn't produce a stronger expression of support for the dollar. But others said they consider some concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely in coming days. \par \par \uc2  'Given the levels we're at, one would imagine that the authorities' concern is quite strong,' said Joe Prendergast, global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  specialist at Merrill Lynch. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-10-95 \par \par \uc2  1629GMT \par \par \uc2  28038 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dra907urx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
