\par\par \b \uc2  Japan's Foreign Reserves -3: Japan Reserves Again Largest \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Oktober 1995\par 09:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The finance ministry maintains a policy of not explaining specifically why the level of foreign reserves changes in any month, and in response to a reporter's question about the influence of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the rise, a ministry official said he couldn't comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  activity. \par \par \uc2  However, economists study the change in reserves in order to estimate the dollar-buying activity of the BOJ in a given month. \par \par \uc2  The official said that judging from most recent statistics available in each country, Japan holds the largest reserves of any nation. \par \par \uc2  At the end of July, Japan's total foreign reserves stood at $158.4 billion. Next was Taiwan (as of the end of June) $101.2 billion. Third was the U.S. with $94.8 billion, while Germany was fourth with $88.3 billion. Singapore, with $65.7 billion, was fifth. \par \par \uc2  He said September's increase marks the 23rd consecutive month-on-month rise in Japan's foreign reserves. He said it also marked the 19th consecutive world record high. \par \par \uc2  The official said the yen's strongest level in September was 96.85 yen to the dollar, posted Sept. 4, while its weakest level, 103.80 yen to the dollar, came Sept. 14. \par \par \uc2  The official said dollar-bullishness pushed the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  up against the yen in the month through Sept. 20, the day the Japanese economic stimulus package was released. He said the end of dollar-supportive factors and the poor U.S. trade data that day, led the dollar to fall toward the end of the month. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-10-95 \par \par \uc2  0758GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dra207lv9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
