\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of Japan Official -2: Should Strive For 'Tension' \b0\par\par\uc2 151 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 1995\par 10:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the dollar must be undertaken flexibly if it is to be effective, an official of the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Speaking with AP-Dow Jones, the official said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  according to specific patterns, which could be easily predicted, would be of limited effectiveness. \par \par \uc2  However, he said continually going against market expectations is counterproductive also, as it in itself represents a type of pattern. \par \par \uc2  He said the BOJ won't gear itself only for surprise \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as this would be likely to disillusion some market players. \par \par \uc2  Above all, he said, properly timed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be sought. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ must strive to give 'a sense of tension' to the market in order to maximize the impact of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-09-95 \par \par \uc2  0819GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr9s07hqt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
