\par\par \b \uc2  U.S. Treasurys In Tokyo Little Changed Despite Volatile Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 September 1995\par 08:57\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar took a wild ride Monday in Tokyo, but prices of U.S. Treasurys were little changed amid caution ahead of Tuesday's meeting of the Federal Reserve's policy-making committee. \par \par \uc2  "We were a little better bid in the early morning on hope for aggressive action by the BOJ to support the dollar," says a dealer at a foreign securities firm. "But when that support didn't materialize the market became a little weaker in thin volume." 6%       2-year 100  8/32   DN  1/32  5.85% 6 1/4%   5-year 100 25/32  Unchanged  6.06 6 1/2%  10-year 101 27/32  Unchanged  6.24 6 7/8%  30-year 103 25/32   UP  1/32  6.58 2-30-Yr Yield Spread: 73 BPS Vs 75 BPs \par \par \uc2  Early in the day the dollar shot up to 101.48 yen amid rumors of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and then plummeted as low as 99.35 yen as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seemed to be doing little to boost the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Late in the day the dollar was 99.50 yen. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday the Federal Reserve's Federal Open Market Committee will meet, and participants are divided about the possibility for any easing in monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  Participants are also waiting for the Tuesday auction of $17.75 billion of two-year notes and the Wednesday auction of $11.50 billion yen of five-year notes. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES NEWS 09-25-95 \par \par \uc2  0257EDT \par \par \uc2  4035 4041 4077 4085 4118 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011024dr9p0279o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
