\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar faces sharp downward correction in Tokyo. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Yoshiko Mori \par \uc2 555 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 September 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Sept 21 (Reuter) - The dollar, which had staged a brilliant recovery against the yen in the past five months, surrendered three yen in little more than a day as enthusiasm over Japan's new economic stimulus steps waned. \par \par \uc2  The dollar plunged to around 101.70 yen in early Tokyo trade after marking a 15-month high of 104.70 yen in New York trade on Tuesday. This compares with the dollar's record low of 79.75 yen marked in April. \par \par \uc2  The greenback began to buckle in Wednesday's Tokyo trade, a day after the Japanese government announced a package of measures worth a total 14.22 trillion yen. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders had expected Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to energetically buy dollars when the package came out, using its release as an opportunity to give the dollar another boost. But the Bank of Japan kept a very low profile. \par \par \uc2  However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did move on Thursday morning, stepping into the market to buy dollars at around 101.90 yen in an attempt to counter a plunge caused by massive dollar sales by U.S. funds and interbank traders. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders were not very surprised by the dollar's sudden feebleness. \par \par \uc2  "A dollar fall of this magnitude is only natural after its almost uninterrupted rise in recent weeks," said Toshihiko Masaki, chief dealer at Citibank N.A. "The yen's real weakness in fact is more accurately reflected in its level against European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  Contrary to its sudden rebound against the dollar, the yen's value against European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  is falling steadily. \par \par \uc2  The mark was at 70.10/13 yen at 0136 GMT, up sharply from 65.65 yen a month ago. The Swiss franc was at 87.30/35 yen, also well above its 79.28 yen value a month earlier. \par \par \uc2  Fred Bergsten, a former senior U.S. official who now heads the Institute for International Economics, objected to official support for a stronger dollar, telling reporters on Wednesday: "The United States should reverse its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy and drive the dollar back down to around 90 yen". \par \par \uc2  "Bergsten was just saying what everyone's thinking because the current market appears to be artificially created. And perhaps the fact that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not aggressively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to push the dollar higher lately may also reflect this view," said Hiroshi Hamaya, dealer at Hokkaido Takushoku Bank. \par \par \uc2  Apart from a natural correction against the yen, dealers cited other factors behind the dollar drop. Some said Japan's spending package, its biggest ever public spending binge, left unresolved thorny issues of tax reform, deregulation, and the financial sector's problems with bad debt. \par \par \uc2  "If the market senses a lack of government willingness to put deregulation policies in place, the market will move in a direction which would urge such deregulation...the return of yen appreciation," a senior U.S. bank trader in Tokyo said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar also took a pounding in New York on Wednesday on news that the U.S. trade deficit widened to $11.5 billion in July from $11.3 billion in June because of shrinking exports. \par \par \uc2  And some dealers said the absence of dollar buying support by U.S. monetary authorities was also keeping the dollar fragile. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr9l03r40\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
