\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr/mark fate hangs in balance as dlr/yen advances. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Anissa Wells \par \uc2 610 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, Sept 14 (Reuter) - As the dollar hovers near 15-month highs against the Japanese yen, inspired mostly by Bank of Japan prodding, many analysts are wondering what is in the cards for dollar/mark. \par \par \uc2  Though dollar/mark has cashed in on the dollar's good fortunes against the yen, analysts said that will likely come to an end fairly soon. \par \par \uc2  "Dollar/mark might go a bit higher because of the drag factor but the air is going to be pretty thin up there," said Amy Smith, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at consulting firm I.D.E.A. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/yen has recovered smartly from a more than 20 percent drop earlier this year due largely to aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's unremitting efforts to weaken the yen. \par \par \uc2  But dollar/mark has lagged dollar/yen. While it has recovered from its fall to a post-World War Two low of 1.3438 marks on March 8, it is still well below the 1.5480-mark level where it started the year. \par \par \uc2  "All of the interest seems to be on dollar/yen as opposed to dollar/mark," said Bob Lynch, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at MMS International. "At the finance ministers' meeting back in April the focus was probably more on weakening the yen and getting Japan's economy off its back." \par \par \uc2  At the Group of Seven finance ministers' meeting in April, the officials called for an orderly reversal of the dollar's decline. \par \par \uc2  Indeed, I.D.E.A.'s Smith said dollar/yen is a "managed \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 " at this juncture. \par \par \uc2  "The BOJ seems prepared to use unlimited \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to insure that and, though the Bundesbank contributed to one August \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , you don't get a sense that they are determined to boost dollar/mark," she added. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the dollar will likely have to struggle to make sustainable gains against the mark, partly because many factors that have bolstered the dollar against the yen have also helped to catapult the mark to highs against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "A great deal of the outflow of investment from Japan has been going directly into mark/yen and it has helped to keep dollar/mark locked in a range," said Kevin Harris, international economist at MCM \b \highlight22\uc2 CurrencyWatch\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Some said there is scope for the mark to climb above the key psychological level of 70 yen -- which would likely bode ill for the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The greenback's outlook against the mark is made that much more murky, analysts said, by the reemergence of political and fiscal concerns in Europe. \par \par \uc2  "We could see European money and bond markets really getting whacked and their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  taking a hit as these problems cause flows into marks and Swiss francs at the dollar's expense," MMS's Lynch said. \par \par \uc2  Lynch also said the dollar could be further undermined as European central banks, which have an ongoing need to build mark reserves, stock up on the German \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "In just about every dollar rally that has occurred, we've seen or heard about this and so long as that persists, it is a potential negative for dollar/mark," Lynch added. \par \par \uc2  Still, some analysts believe some dollar negatives could be offset by expectations for lower German money market rates. \par \par \uc2  In addition, the prospect of Italy, Finland and Sweden entering the European exchange rate mechanism (ERM) soon also could work in the dollar's favor, they said. \par \par \uc2  "As that becomes clear, it could put significant pressure on the mark," said David Gilmore, partner at New York-based \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Analytics. \par \par \uc2  --212-859-1662 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr9e0419a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
