\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  uses electronic  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  - traders. \b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Sept 14 (Reuter) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) appears to have used one of the major electronic broking systems for its recent dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Tokyo traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not just called commercial banks to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market last Friday but had asked them to channel its dollar bids to MINEX, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Officials at the BOJ and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  in charge of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  asked some commercial banks to channel bids on the dollar to the MINEX screen, and it was probably the first time that they have done so," said a bank \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager. \par \par \uc2  MINEX was launched in March 1991 by Tokyo \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Co Ltd and other Japanese firms and is mostly used in Asian trading hours. \par \par \uc2  "Using electronic brokers for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  raises the visibility and efficiency of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  as dealers can easily see big dollar bids are sitting at places below the market," said a senior bank trader. \par \par \uc2  Bankers said there had been many cases in the past when BOJ dollar bids, or at least a part of them, which were initially placed at banks were channelled to the electronic broking system without the BOJ's knowledge or control. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr9e040yr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
