\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Focus: Others Unlikely To Join BoJ's  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2  By NICHOLAS HASTINGS \par \uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 September 1995\par 09:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LONDON (AP-DJ)--Aggressive Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the dollar early Wednesday has put the market on red alert for coordinated action with the U.S. and Germany. \par \par \uc2  However, market analysts doubt it will come. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche Bundesbank is seen reluctant to join in while German interest rates are being reduced and pressures on the U.S. Federal Reserve to act are believed to have eased considerably since the three central banks got together to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in mid_August. \par \par \uc2  Nick Stamenkovic, an economist at DKB International PLC, said that while the Bank of Japan's solo activity might be a prelude to a larger exercise, he doubts the Bundesbank will be involved. \par \par \uc2  'It has already cut its discount rate and is nudging its (securities) repurchase rate lower,' he said, noting the German \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's general reluctance to undermine the strength of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'The Bundesbank will probably sit on the sidelines for the time being,' he predicted. \par \par \uc2  Stephen King, international economist at James Capel & Co., is just as convinced that 'the incentive for (coordinated) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has dropped significantly.' \par \par \uc2  He said the Bundesbank was willing to participate in mid-August as it hadn't yet cut its discount rate and was eager to show beleaguered German exporters that the Deutsche mark could go down as well up. \par \par \uc2  'But at this stage,' he added, 'there is no need for the Deutsche mark to go dramatically further.' King suggested there is only a 20% chance of the German \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  entering the market now. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-09-95 \par \par \uc2  0739GMT \par \par \uc2  1066 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr9606u41\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
