\par\par \b \uc2  Japan Stocks Dn Midday On Arb. Selling; Nikkei Down 0.2% \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 September 1995\par 03:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--Tokyo stocks have fallen back from earlier morning gains on unwinding of arbitrage positions ahead of Friday's settlement of September's futures and options contacts, and profit taking, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The Nikkei index of 225 selected issues was 43.81 points lower at 17,750.23 at 0155 GMT. The official morning close will be announced shortly. The index rose 45.52 points Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The market was led higher in the early morning on buying of semiconductor-related high technology stocks, which followed the gains made by their U.S. counterparts Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 's announcement Wednesday that Japan's unadjusted trade surplus for July fell 21% year-on-year to $9.22 billion also helped the market by boosting the value of the dollar, which also got a lift from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The dollar is trading around 98.96 yen around 0150 GMT, up from 97.50 yen in late New York action Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  But after the Nikkei hit an early high of 17,898.83, up 104.79 points, nearly 40 minutes after the opening, investors saw an occasion to take profits, traders said. Share prices have also slipped on moderate unwinding of arbitrage positions, they say. \par \par \uc2  Electronics shares remain higher, but have slipped slightly from early levels. NEC is 30 yen higher at 1,350 but 10 yen off its intraday high. Fujitsu, which rose to 1,150 in the early morning, is trading at 1,140, up 10 yen on the day. And Oki Electric Industry, traded at 931 yen in mid-morning, is 22 yen up at 929. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-09-95 \par \par \uc2  0157GMT \par \par \uc2  5011 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr9606tz0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
