y 5 basis points,' he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-08-95 \par \par \uc2  2147GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr8m06dg8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
