\par\par \b \uc2  Japan Debt -2-: Short Rate Rise Overdone, Correction Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 386 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 August 1995\par 09:52\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Following coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the U.S. and Germany on Tuesday, the dollar this session hit intraday highs of 98.90 yen, the highest since posting intraday highs of 99.02 yen on Feb. 14. The dollar has come off a bit on profit-taking to currently trade at around 98.15 yen, well above 96.94 yen in New York late Tuesday and 93.65 yen late in Tokyo Tuesday. The Nikkei stock index soared, ending the session up 706.01 points at 18,158.73. The index closed above 18,000 for the first time since Feb. 22. In this environment, the yield of the benchmark 10-year government bond rose above 3.2% for the first time since mid-May while the price of the lead September futures contract for 10-year bond fell below 117 for the first time in three months. While the impact from exchange rates and equities on the long end of the yield curve is understandable, a jump in interest rate futures and three-month certificates of deposit (CDs) is overdone, traders say. \par \par \uc2   "There is no reason for short rates to surge to this level," says Yamashita at Mitsubishi Bank. Rates for new three-month CDs is up 0.05 percentage point at 0.90%, the highest level since July 7 when the rate was 1.16%. The Bank of Japan led short-term market rates about 0.50 point lower on July 7. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't seen bringing short-term market rates back to their pre-easing levels, as it hasn't changed its overall prognosis on the economy, traders say. But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't seen preventing market rates from rising to levels near the 1.00% discount rate, says the trader at the big bank. "Participants will continue to seek new levels in line with the latest development in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stocks," the trader says. As expected, the Bank of Japan was neutral in its money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the first day of the new monthly reserves accumulation period this session, leaving reserves even with the requirement. The key unsecured overnight call rate is down 0.09 percentage point at 0.87% \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS 08-16-95 \par \par \uc2  0352EDT \par \par \uc2  4077 4153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011024dr8g01xhm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
