\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr Soars On Coordinated  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\uc2 : World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Rdp \b0\par\par\uc2  By RENA S. MILLER \par \uc2 326 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 1995\par 22:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (AP-DJ)--The dollar soared to its highest levels in nearly six months Tuesday, as aggressive coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the central banks of the U.S., Germany, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Switzerland caught many market players by surprise and triggered a broad-based dollar rally. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's gains reversed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's heavy losses in March and April of this year, the months which saw the dollar fall to historic lows against the Deutsche mark and yen. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the prominence of the Bundesbank's participation in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , combined with data showing a shrinking Japanese trade surplus with the U.S., and very light volume because of summer holidays, all contributed to the success of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'This is one of the most successful \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in years,' said David DeRosa, a director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at Swiss Bank Corp. in New York. 'The main event was that they got the Bundesbank to come in in a very determined way.' \par \par \uc2  The Bundesbank has hitherto been seen as a reluctant participant in co-ordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the dollar. Indeed, the last major \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying on July 7 involved only the Federal Reserve and the Bank of Japan. \par \par \uc2  One source close to the Bundesbank said the German \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  played a leading role in coordinating the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday, after it saw a 'favorable constellation' of factors in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. Conditions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market were persuasive enough to overcome the Bundesbank's typical reluctance to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, the source said. \par \par \uc2  Late in New York, the dollar was quoted at 1.4778 Deutsche marks, up from 1.4360 marks late Monday in New York. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also quoted at 96.94 yen, up from 93.65 yen. Sterling was trading at $1.5534, down from $1.5707. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-08-95 \par \par \uc2  2046GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr8f06705\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
