\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr Surges on  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\uc2 , New  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Policy: World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2  By JOSEPH REBELLO \par \uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 August 1995\par 22:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (AP-DJ)--The dollar surged to a five-month high against the yen Wednesday, propelled by \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and by a novel Japanese government policy aimed at weakening the yen. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's ascent was the result, traders said, of one of the most successful \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in years, a move that buoyed the dollar not only against the yen also but against most other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  spiked to an intraday high of 91.01 yen, its highest level since March 14, after the U.S. Federal Reserve and the Bank of Japan acted in concert to boost the dollar. Meanwhile, Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced a package of measures to push the yen down. \par \par \uc2  The package aroused what many traders termed 'euphoria' in the market. Analysts noted that the Japanese government has long tended to introduce measures - such as stimulus packages - aimed at curbing the onerous effects of a strong yen. But it has not been known to actually move to curb the yen's strength. \par \par \uc2  'This is a watershed,' said Marc Chandler, a senior analyst at Deutsche Bank in New York. 'I think it means that, at least for the next six months, the dollar has bottomed.' \par \par \uc2  Late in New York, the dollar was quoted at 1.3979 Deutsche marks, up from 1.3762 marks late Tuesday in New York. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also quoted at 90.95 yen, up from 88.05 yen. Sterling was trading at $1.6005, down from $1.6070. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-08-95 \par \par \uc2  2056GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr8205v22\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
