\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ's July dollar purchases estimated at $686 mln. \b0\par\par\uc2 228 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Juli 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, July 31 (Reuter) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) bought an estimated $686 million in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in July, down from $1.33 billion in June, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  The figures include the last two trading days of the previous month, but not the last two business days of this month, as \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  settlements are made two days after transactions. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ data released today showed that capital outlays from the government special \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account to the private sector totalled 58 billion yen in July. \par \par \uc2  The figure is mostly composed of yen payments from the government \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account to the private sector, mainly commercial banks. Such yen payments are a result of BOJ dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the yen. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which manages the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account, raises yen in cash for its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by issuing special financing bills (FBs) for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The FBs are also used to convert dollar-denominated income gains on the government external reserves into yen. \par \par \uc2  Outstanding FBs as of July 31 totalled 24.14 trillion yen, up 119 billion yen from a month earlier. \par \par \uc2  In July, the MOF sold two billion yen worth of FBs outright in the market, contributing to capital outlays from the private sector to the government special \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr7v05hdp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
