\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup: Dlr Up In Mostly Quiet Dealings \b0\par\par\uc2  By DAVID JOLLY \par \uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juli 1995\par 07:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar was higher Wednesday than its levels in New York late Tuesday, in mostly subdued dealings. \par \par \uc2  Though there was little news of substance in Asian dealings, a rumor of an imminent easing of Japan's official discount rate (ODR) sent a ripple through the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in the Tokyo afternoon, with the dollar bid on the talk. The ODR sits currently at a record low of 1.0%. \par \par \uc2  But the Bank of Japan denied the rumor, with an official saying such talk is 'mistaken.' The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no plans to hold either an extraordinary policy meeting or make any kind of special announcement, he said. \par \par \uc2  As for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the dollar, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared relatively quiet on the day, with traders unable to confirm any buying activity. However, several traders said it appeared the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars during the day. \par \par \uc2  'It's been pretty quiet,' said Ken Yumoto, assistant treasurer at Chase Manhattan Bank in Tokyo. 'The dollar's well bid at 87.00 yen and there are good offers at 88.00/10 yen,' meaning the dollar will likely continue range-bound versus the yen for the near-term. \par \par \uc2  Around 0530 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 88.00 yen, above 87.71 yen late Tuesday in New York and above 87.85 yen late Tuesday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.3938 Deutsche marks, slightly above 1.3935 marks late Tuesday in New York but below 1.3949 marks in London Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 63.13 yen, back up from 62.94 yen in New York late Tuesday and 62.98 yen in London late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 26-07-95 \par \par \uc2  0538GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr7q05njc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
