\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Midday: Dlr Mixed; BOJ Buying Said Continuing \b0\par\par\uc2 358 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juli 1995\par 04:09\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar is stronger versus the mark and yen at midday in Tokyo Tuesday than its levels early in the session, but slightly down versus the pound. Traders said the dollar was helped up by a combination of mark-yen buying and continued Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders reported seeing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market not long after 0001 GMT, buying dollars around 87.60 yen and above. Since then, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is rumored to have been more or less constantly buying the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But traders said the dollar has also gotten some support from the mark's gains against the yen. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is seen trading at 87.30-88.00 yen and 1.3810-1.3875 marks in Asian dealings Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said a dollar break of resistance at 88.00 yen isn't impossible, but that given good selling interest at that level, still seems unlikely in Tokyo time. \par \par \uc2  However, 'if the BOJ decides to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively, they might be able to push it up quite a bit,' said a European trader. 'There really isn't much else going on.' \par \par \uc2  Around 0200 GMT, the dollar is trading at 87.93 yen, up from 87.78 yen around 0030 GMT and above 87.45 yen in New York late Monday. The dollar was quoted at 88.28 yen in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.3869 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.3860 marks earlier in Tokyo and above 1.3853 marks late Monday in New York. The dollar was at 1.3860 marks in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is at 63.40 yen, up from 63.33 yen earlier in Tokyo and well above 63.13 yen in New York late Monday. The mark was quoted in Tokyo late Monday at 63.69 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5955, up from $1.5944 earlier in Tokyo and above $1.5950 in New York late Monday. Sterling was at $1.5960 in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-07-95 \par \par \uc2  0209GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr7p05lum\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
