so is at 1.3860 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.3851 marks late Friday in New York and just below 1.3865 marks in London Friday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 63.69 yen, down from 63.89 yen in New York late Friday and below 63.87 yen in London late Friday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-07-95 \par \par \uc2  0538GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr7o05g0z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
