\par\par \b \uc2  = \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  View -2-: Discreet  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Has Desired Impact \b0\par\par\uc2 370 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juli 1995\par 23:32\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Aside from stepping up the magnitude of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the BOJ also has changed the way it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analysts and traders note. In the past, the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced its intentions. But for the past month, the BOJ has practiced much more discretion. For example, recently, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has used more U.S. banks outside of Toyko trading hours for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , I.D.E.A.'s Smith notes. "It's a very strategic way of making it look like there's more natural demand for dollars than there really is," she says. Others point to the fact that the BOJ hasn't combined its recent bout of dollar buying with an offsetting money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  as reason for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's success. "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  rescued the yen less with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  than with a blast of liquidity, by letting \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  go unsterilized," says Andrew Hodge, financial strategist at Bank Brussels Lambert in New York. \par \par \uc2   "With easy money and more liquidity, part of which may have come from the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , you can provide enough yen to make sure the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't strengthen." Unsterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  means the BOJ bought dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market without offsetting the purchases through transactions in Japan's domestic money market. It's generally believed that sterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has minimal impact on exchange rates. But even if the BOJ persists in its attempt to limit the yen's gains through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the key to tempering the surge in the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the longer term lies in Japan's fiscal management, some add. "Japan is running a policy mix which is deflationary, and deflation is really great for your \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," says William O'Grady, futures analyst at A.G. Edwards Inc., St. Louis. To stem the yen's strength over the long haul, O'Grady says, Japan needs to refocus its domestic policy with tax cuts and spending incentives to flood the market with yen. Late Friday in New York, the dollar traded at 88.49 yen and 1.3857 Deutsche marks, compared with 88.20 and 1.3808 late Thursday in New York. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES NEWS 07-23-95 \par \par \uc2  1732EDT \par \par \uc2  4137 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011024dr7n01r84\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
