\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -3: Renewed Confidence in Dlr Vs Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 322 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 1995\par 23:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  As the dollar recovered, traders regained their optimism about the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's prospects versus the yen. The dollar should hit 90 yen, they said. \par \par \uc2  But not this week or next as had been predicted before Wednesday's selloff. Most traders say it might take the dollar as long as two months to reach that point, which is regarded as an important objective because Japanese officials have termed it desirable. \par \par \uc2  Because the strong yen is hurting Japan's already weak economy, Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has anxiously tried to push the dollar higher, nudging it up with repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the last two weeks. But the more the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the more resistant the dollar became. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the dollar rose slightly in early Asian trading on rumors - unconfirmed - that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Recognizing the dollar's resistance, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  is now moving much more quietly, traders said. \par \par \uc2  But its determination to bolster the dollar hasn't been diluted. Early Thursday, a Bank of Japan official who asked not to be identified said the bank is 'not satisfied' with its supposed target of 90 yen. He said the bank aims to push the dollar higher. \par \par \uc2  Such comments, in addition to assertions by other Japanese officials that the Fed is acting in concert with the Bank of Japan to move the dollar higher, have had an unpredictable effect on the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'This story dies and then it comes back to life, but there is no substantive indication that there's any agreement between the U.S. and Japan,' said David DeRosa, a director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at Swiss Bank Corp. 'I'm surprised the U.S. just hasn't come out and said, 'Yes, it's true' or 'No, it's not true'.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-07-95 \par \par \uc2  2127GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr7k05klu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
